.container
  .about-page
    .heading
      %h5 who we are 
      %h1 
        We are a group of designers, developers, writers and thinkers from the agency world and Silicon Valley who solve business problems for forward-thinking companies.

    .what-we-do
      .thing
        .picture
          %img{:src => "static/Tandem.svg"}
        .text 
          %h1 We help fast-growing companies run faster.
          %p Our founders met at the fastest growing company in history. We understand that growth, scalability, and product iteration are hard.

      .thing
        .picture
          %img{:src => "static/WebBrowser.svg"}
        .text 
          %h1 We design and build stuff on the web. 
          %p Among other things. We create inspiring customer experiences through brand, product, and marketing across the entire customer journey.

      .thing
        .picture
          %img{:src => "static/Nest.svg"}
        .text 
          %h1 We treat your business like it's our own. 
          %p That means solving high-impact problems that may not always have shiny solutions.  Not everyone thinks that’s fun. We do.

      .thing
        .picture
          %img{:src => "static/Glasses.svg"}
        .text 
          %h1 Not in business to be business people.
          %p Jon and Jess are makers above all else. We do the heavy lifting on every project and bring on the right people for the right challenges, helping you save time and money.

      .thing
        .picture
          %img{:src => "static/IceCream.svg"}
        .text 
          %h1 Nice work. Nice people.
          %p We combine the creative expertise of top agency talent with the business acumen and technical capabilities of Silicon Valley, minus the ego. 

.about-page
  .work-with-us
    .container
      .inner
        %h5 work with us 
        %h1 See us as an extension of your team. Work with Jon. Work with Jess. Work with Jon and Jess. Work with Jon and Jess and a hand-picked strike team. 
        %form{:action => "contact.html"}
